# ⚡ Step 8: Power Up & Test

### Start the System

1️⃣ Power ON the ESP32

2️⃣ Connect ESP32 to Wi-Fi

3️⃣ Wait for Blynk Cloud Connection

4️⃣ Open the Blynk Mobile App

5️⃣ Press the Relay Switch


